#5669
Grandmaster's Bedchamber~
This section of the Onyx chamber is almost entirely taken up by a huge canopy
bed in the center of the room.  It is covered with various animal furs and
pillows no doubt filled with the finest down.  Definitely the private rooms 
of someone very powerful and very rich.  
